  "content": "<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/RjWCgrnBZz\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1066142815043719208?color=7289da&label=Discord&logo=discord&logoColor=7289da&style=for-the-badge\" width=\"272\" height=\"41\"></span></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/xYmrwP9/description.png\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\">🛈</span> Ender Difficulty 是一个专为“Beyond The End”整合包制作的模组。</span><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:24px\"><br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\">🛈</span> 它添加了一个新的新世界菜单，包含三种新的难度：普通、困难和噩梦。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\">🛈</span> 此模组需要安装 Gamestages 和 Forever Night Stages 才能运行。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\">🛈</span> 此模组支持客户端和服务器端。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/dcZcCdK/banner-5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"94\"></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>美术人员</strong></span></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">🛈</span> Incognitoankh:&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.fiverr.com%252fankhasmodeus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fiverr 链接</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">🛈</span> ZenoKim: <a hr